					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rumetzen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(209204); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=209204&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609233399" alt="rumetzen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=209204)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rumetzen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(209204); return false;" >rumetzen</a></span> <span class="odate time_1491348330 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">04 Apr 2017 23:25</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2783773">
									

<p>Understandable, but I think trying to overexplain everything tends to make people <em>likely</em> to suspend disbelief. A lot of the times I find putting in to many details just opens up more opportunities for people to nitpick/criticize/find plot holes, and most will just an accept a basic explanation or even no explanation at all.</p>
<p>I'm looking forward to seeing more from you!</p>

